course: dictionary
lesson: 14088
title: Meg: a name, a short word, and slang
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words look the same but mean different things. Meg is one of them. Look for clues in the words around it. A capital M and a person in the sentence tell you it is a name. «Meg is my best friend, and she loves drawing.» Meg is a girl here, not a computer word or a kind of ball.
explain: Numbers and talk of files are clues too. «My tablet has only 3 megs of free space left.» Here meg is short for megabyte, a unit that measures how much a file holds. Ask yourself: is this describing a person, or something you could count?
explain: Some words are informal, which means they are chatty and not used in formal writing. «Meg» is short for megabyte in computer talk, and «megs» is slang for it. Check which kind of writing you are in before you use it.
fact: Meg is a girl's name, short for Margaret or Megan.
fact: In «Little Women», Meg March is the eldest of the four sisters.
fact: A capital M at the start of a word, such as Meg, often shows a name.
fact: In computing, «megs» is informal short for megabytes, a measure of file size.
fact: In football slang, «meg» means to kick the ball between an opponent's legs; it is informal, so do not use it in a formal test.
exercise: «Meg is my best friend, and she loves drawing.» What kind of word is Meg here? | A computer file | *A name for a girl | A type of drawing | A kick in football
exercise: «My tablet has only 3 megs of free space left.» What does megs mean here? | A girl's name | To kick a ball between legs | A kind of tablet | *Megabytes, a measure of how much a file holds
exercise: «Meg March is the sensible sister in Little Women.» What clue tells you that Meg is a name? | The word sensible, which is a file | Nothing, it could be anything | The word sister, which is a ball | *The capital M and the person called Meg March
test: «Meg, Jo, Beth and Amy are sisters in Little Women.» Who is Meg? | A file size on a computer | A type of football pitch | *One of the four sisters in the book | A kick between someone's legs
test: «The photo is 3 megs, so it will not fit in the email.» What does megs mean? | A girl's name | A kind of sweet | To kick the ball | *Megabytes
exam: Meg is short for which girl's name? | *Margaret | Thomas | Oliver | Maria
